{"title": "Quickened Mage Hand", "pageid": 52130, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Quickened_Mage_Hand", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Quickened Mage Hand</b> is a passive feature that modifies the cantrip <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Hand\" title=\"Mage Hand\">Mage Hand</a> to cost a bonus action instead of a regular action.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Hand\" title=\"Mage Hand\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Mage_Hand_Icon.webp/25px-Mage_Hand_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Mage_Hand_Icon.webp/38px-Mage_Hand_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Mage_Hand_Icon.webp/50px-Mage_Hand_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mage Hand\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Mage_Hand_Icon.webp/25px-Mage_Hand_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Mage_Hand_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Hand\" title=\"Mage Hand\">Mage Hand</a> as a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hr%27a%27cknir_Bracers\" title=\"Hr'a'cknir Bracers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Hr%27a%27cknir_Bracers_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hr%27a%27cknir_Bracers_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Hr%27a%27cknir_Bracers_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Hr%27a%27cknir_Bracers_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Hr%27a%27cknir_Bracers_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Hr%27a%27cknir_Bracers_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Hr%27a%27cknir_Bracers_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hr%27a%27cknir_Bracers_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Hr%27a%27cknir_Bracers_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hr%27a%27cknir_Bracers\" title=\"Hr'a'cknir Bracers\">Hr'a'cknir Bracers</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Quickened Mage Hand</b> does not grant the Mage Hand spell, but instead unlocks a spell variant - swapping the Action Point cost for a Bonus Action Point.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202943\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nCompl